    {
      "id": "2d4a33022c681c88",
      "title": "Show HN: ANMA, boundary contracts for cheaper AI coding agents",
      "source": "Hacker News (AI 关键词)",
      "category": "A",
      "url": "https://github.com/anma-labs/anma",
      "published_raw": "Sun, 21 Jun 2026 23:41:02 +0000",
      "published_parsed": [
        2026,
        6,
        21,
        23,
        41,
        2,
        6,
        172,
        0
      ],
      "raw_text": "<p>I built ANMA because I noticed that cheaper models would often ignore architecture rules. So I did several benchmarks using \"Claude Haiku 4.5\" with and without ANMA; without ANMA it ignored the \"rules\" 13 out of 19 runs, with ANMA, 0 out of 20 runs.<p>What is \"ANMA\"? \nYAML contracts with CLAUDE.md, hooks, and CI checks<p>What about stronger/expensive models?\nThey followed the architecture rules.<p>The question is, would cheaper models with stronger rules be the best affordable default for coding?</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48623765\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48623765</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 1</p>",
      "published_at": "2026-06-22T07:41:02+08:00",
      "keep": true,
      "scores": {
        "source_authority_score": 50,
        "freshness_score": 85,
        "ai_relevance_score": 75,
        "product_relevance_score": 70,
        "technical_impact_score": 65,
        "community_heat_score": 25
      },
      "final_score": 64,
      "summary_zh": "开发者发布ANMA框架，通过YAML合约结合CLAUDE.md和CI检查约束AI编程Agent遵守架构规则。实测Claude Haiku 4.5在无ANMA时13/19次违规，有ANMA后20次全部合规，探索以廉价模型加强规则替代昂贵模型的可行路径。",
      "why_zh": "低成本模型配合强约束可媲美贵模型效果，为AI编程降本增效提供新思路。",
      "tags": [
        "AI Coding",
        "Agent",
        "Open Source"
      ]
    }
  ],
